From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dan Harrington <harringtond@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 10:55:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [upstream] [Android IME] Don't restart input when refocusing
 the same node

- Pass state.node_id from ImeAdapterAndroid::UpdateState to ImeAdapterImpl.updateState.
- Skip restartInput() on mRestartInputOnNextStateUpdate if the focused editable DOM node ID has not changed (e.g. synchronous blur() + focus() on the same element), preventing IMEs like Gboard from resetting active key-repeat timers.

Bug: b:570160537
Change-Id: Ia4b3e42d084e959a9667c7bf3ed2432f6a6a6964
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8522588
Commit-Queue: Dan H <harringtond@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Jinsuk Kim <jinsukkim@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1713614}
(cherry picked from commit 164645fc126f364501c49cd57291ce56177b51f3)
---
 .../browser/android/ime_adapter_android.cc    |  2 +-
 .../content/browser/input/ImeAdapterImpl.java | 29 +++++--
 .../browser/input/ImeAdapterImplTest.java     | 85 ++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 107 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/content/browser/android/ime_adapter_android.cc b/content/browser/android/ime_adapter_android.cc
index 58908eb38d28a..4d528cd901ceb 100644
--- a/content/browser/android/ime_adapter_android.cc
+++ b/content/browser/android/ime_adapter_android.cc
@@ -233,7 +233,7 @@ void ImeAdapterAndroid::UpdateState(const ui::mojom::TextInputState& state) {
       state.composition ? state.composition.value().end() : -1,
       state.reply_to_request,
       static_cast<int>(state.last_vk_visibility_request),
-      static_cast<int>(state.vk_policy), j_ime_text_spans);
+      static_cast<int>(state.vk_policy), state.node_id, j_ime_text_spans);
 }
 
 void ImeAdapterAndroid::UpdateOnTouchDown() {
